#==============================================================================================
#
#   animation_playback_event - Animations::AnimationPlaybackEvent: the finish, cancel and
#                              remove events of an animation
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of Libraries/LibWeb/Animations/AnimationPlaybackEvent.cpp (lines 1-79), by region
#       p4a: an Event carrying the animation's current time and its timeline's time as
#       nullable CSSNumberish values (a CSSNumericValue is the typed OM, phase 3). The
#       prototype (WEB_SET_PROTOTYPE_FOR_INTERFACE) waits for the bindings (phase 3).
